{
  "esm": "1.0.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "varcoeff_face_laplacian_lev_interior",
    "description": "Interior-only conservative finite-volume variable-coefficient Laplacian d/dz(K du/dz) on column_nonuniform_1d with the coefficient K supplied AT THE INTERFACES (shape [lev_nodes]): L u[k] = ( K[k+1] (u[k+1]-u[k])/(zc[k+1]-zc[k]) - K[k] (u[k]-u[k-1])/(zc[k]-zc[k-1]) ) / dz[k] over k in [2, NLEV-1]. Interface numbering: K[k] lives on the interface BELOW layer k (node 1 is the surface, node k separates layers k-1 and k, node NLEV+1 is the model top), so the flux through the interface above layer k uses K[k+1]. This is exactly how atmospheric PBL schemes define their exchange coefficients -- e.g. WRF/CCPP YSU's xkzh(k), 'at the interface between k and k+1', is K[k+1] here -- so no face averaging is performed or needed (contrast grids/cartesian_uniform_1d/stencils/varcoeff_laplacian_interior, which averages a CELL-centred coefficient to the faces). Match-less named template; rules/varcoeff_face_laplacian_lev_flux_bc wraps it with the two boundary-flux layers. `zc` and `dz` are the consumer's free-name geometry observeds (grids/column_nonuniform_1d/grid.esm). Second-order in L2 on a smoothly stretched column (supraconvergent); reduces to the classical three-point form on a uniform column with uniform K.",
    "license": "MIT",
    "tags": [
      "esd:stencil",
      "family:finite_volume",
      "grid:column_nonuniform_1d",
      "op:varcoeff_laplacian",
      "order:2",
      "stencil_width:3"
    ],
    "references": [
      {
        "citation": "LeVeque, R. J. (2007). Finite Difference Methods for Ordinary and Partial Differential Equations. SIAM. Section 2.13 (nonuniform grids)."
      }
    ]
  },
  "expression_template_imports": [
    {
      "ref": "../grid.esm"
    }
  ],
  "expression_templates": {
    "varcoeff_face_laplacian_lev_interior": {
      "params": [
        "u",
        "K"
      ],
      "body": {
        "op": "aggregate",
        "output_idx": [
          "k"
        ],
        "args": [
          "u",
          "K"
        ],
        "ranges": {
          "k": [
            2,
            {
              "op": "-",
              "args": [
                "NLEV",
                1
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        "expr": {
          "op": "/",
          "args": [
            {
              "op": "-",
              "args": [
                {
                  "op": "*",
                  "args": [
                    {
                      "op": "index",
                      "args": [
                        "K",
                        {
                          "op": "+",
                          "args": [
                            "k",
                            1
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "op": "/",
                      "args": [
                        {
                          "op": "-",
                          "args": [
                            {
                              "op": "index",
                              "args": [
                                "u",
                                {
                                  "op": "+",
                                  "args": [
                                    "k",
                                    1
                                  ]
                                }
                              ]
                            },
                            {
                              "op": "index",
                              "args": [
                                "u",
                                "k"
                              ]
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "op": "-",
                          "args": [
                            {
                              "op": "index",
                              "args": [
                                "zc",
                                {
                                  "op": "+",
                                  "args": [
                                    "k",
                                    1
                                  ]
                                }
                              ]
                            },
                            {
                              "op": "index",
                              "args": [
                                "zc",
                                "k"
                              ]
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "op": "*",
                  "args": [
                    {
                      "op": "index",
                      "args": [
                        "K",
                        "k"
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "op": "/",
                      "args": [
                        {
                          "op": "-",
                          "args": [
                            {
                              "op": "index",
                              "args": [
                                "u",
                                "k"
                              ]
                            },
                            {
                              "op": "index",
                              "args": [
                                "u",
                                {
                                  "op": "-",
                                  "args": [
                                    "k",
                                    1
                                  ]
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "op": "-",
                          "args": [
                            {
                              "op": "index",
                              "args": [
                                "zc",
                                "k"
                              ]
                            },
                            {
                              "op": "index",
                              "args": [
                                "zc",
                                {
                                  "op": "-",
                                  "args": [
                                    "k",
                                    1
                                  ]
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "op": "index",
              "args": [
                "dz",
                "k"
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
